        "original_id": "fc0464d9-368d-579e-8d2d-3a3271e7f996",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk, Lever Brothers, Margarine Unie, Unilever\n- Places: Indonesia, Angke, Jakarta\n- Products: soap\n- Media: Bringing Up Father (radio)\n\nFacts:\n- In 1930, Lever Brothers merged with Margarine Unie to form Unilever.\n- On December 5, 1933, PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk was established in Indonesia as Lever Zeepfabrieken N.V.\n- PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk was a subsidiary of Lever Brothers when it was established.\n- PT Unilever Indonesia Tbk initially operated a soap factory at Angke, Jakarta.\n- Lever Brothers was the sponsor of Bringing Up Father, a radio program.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
